1
00:00:00,959 --> 00:00:03,949
(Raj:)The guy's a genius. Maybe you weren't
challenging enough for him.

2
00:00:04,196 --> 00:00:06,726
(Sheldon:)Not challenging?
I was humiliating the man.

3
00:00:06,932 --> 00:00:08,902
(Sheldon:)I was thinking of writing a book called...

4
00:00:09,067 --> 00:00:12,937
(Sheldon:)...A Brief History of the Time I Made
Stephen Hawking Cry Like a Little Girl.

5
00:00:13,939 --> 00:00:17,379
(Howard:)There's the problem.
You can't beat Hawking like that.

6
00:00:17,576 --> 00:00:20,846
(Howard:)He hates to lose.
Everyone knows the guy's a big baby.

7
00:00:21,046 --> 00:00:23,876
(Howard:)I mean, forget the wheelchair,
he should be in a stroller.

8
00:00:27,252 --> 00:00:28,582
(Penny:)Really?

9
00:00:28,754 --> 00:00:30,584
(Howard:)One time when I was working with him...

10
00:00:30,756 --> 00:00:33,246
(Howard:)...he said that Johnny Depp
was in The Matrix.

11
00:00:33,458 --> 00:00:36,218
(Howard:)I told him he was wrong,
but he kept insisting.

12
00:00:36,428 --> 00:00:38,728
(Howard:)So I looked it up online and showed him.

13
00:00:39,164 --> 00:00:45,364
(Howard:)Well, the next day, he had a pizza party,
and everyone got invited but me.

14
00:00:46,972 --> 00:00:47,992
And then he was all:

15
00:00:48,173 --> 00:00:52,373
"Your invitation
must've gotten lost in the matrix."

16
00:00:55,681 --> 00:00:58,741
(Sheldon:)Good Lord. What have I done?

